{"Stateful handlers like MetricAlertDetectorHandler have not been updated to implement the new occurrence-building hook for non-OK transitions, causing them to either fail instantiation due to the abstract method or fail at runtime when evaluation reaches the triggered path": 0.8754891753196716, "The new group_type property raises ValueError when self.type is not registered, and detector_handler now delegates to it unconditionally, breaking the previous behavior where callers like process_detectors() could skip invalid detectors without crashing by receiving None": 0.3933558762073517, "get_detectors_for_event_data docstring still describes a list return type but the function now returns an EventDetectors object (or None), creating a factual mismatch after the refactor": 0.03763524070382118, "In test_state_results_multi_group, the expected second result uses value 6 instead of 10 for group_2 when calling build_mock_occurrence_and_event, despite the data_packet containing {\"group_1\": 6, \"group_2\": 10}, causing the test to assert against incorrect occurrence payloads": 0.9053230285644531}